{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "That was close. I was almost out of booze in there. What took you so long ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 54,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Those pirates attacked us at sea. I had to fix the engine, so it slowed down a bit.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Right...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 54,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Anyway, you know what you need to do.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Yeah, but it's gonna be more complicated that we envisioned. They wrecked my workshop, but more importantly they stole the engine.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 54,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Damn it. We'll have to get it back.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "What is it?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "The most efficient Blade Engine ever built, based on the designed made by the Hero himself!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 54,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Sick! Can't you make it again?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "It's not that simple. We have been working on it for years...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Do you have any idea where the pirates went?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "As a matter of fact, I do.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Where are we going? ",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You're going to Archades.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You're kidding.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Aren't we gonna be like, executed on the spot?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You'll have to be discrete and lay low. I trust you guys.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Hold on, Mir. Aren't you coming?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "We don't have time. I'll stay here with Olphus and help him repair the workshop and get prepared. You guys take the Tidepiercer and head to an abandoned mine, South of the Eastern Continent. That's where the pirates should be going.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "It's impossible. The Archadians will kill us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "If it all goes well, they won't even find you. If they they do, these should keep you safe.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "They're hunter medals...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "But they're a bit weird.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "These are Archadian hunter medals. They bear my crest. You should be able to avoid getting arrested as long as you don't steer trouble.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Does that mean we're officially Hunters ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 1,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I mean, you guys have been killing Pluvials left and right, so it's pretty much justified.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That's pretty rad... Although I would have preferred some from our village.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Don't worry. When this is all over we'll have them made.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I'll get in touch with my friend there. He'll join you and act as your guide. I wish you all luck. I know you can do this.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        }
    ]
}